{"id":3213,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>&nbsp; 祥龙摆尾辞旧岁，金蛇纳福迎春来！2025年1月7日，计算机科学与技术学院在软件大楼527举办了“智汇新春，码绘锦程”2025年迎新春教职工茶话会。茶话会邀请了校党委常委、副校长刘俊以及学院毕业的职能部门老师、学院全体教职工共80余人参加。</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;活动伊始，刘俊副校长发表了热情洋溢的新春致辞，他向全院教职工致以新年的问候和美好的祝愿，对学院近年来取得的成绩表示祝贺，充分肯定了教职工的辛勤付出和为学校“双一流”创建所做的贡献，并对学院下一步发展提出了明确要求。</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=FL8U9DL4Q2LmAVMAmGiUlC8LRAfMRl1PUzlDLmrRnNrRLz-0gihFp2hmCIa0L1yDUSybokh7UmT2U47PLRMfMmC8UNUsUlLsn77bLRM2nzWFUNUaUzr2M4nFLz9PL8lJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47aLzC0oz7Yokbw62m8c&oid=1391370217&tid=1016&nid=9128&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/26A98DB9FC1103A664BD7AC7DA903FE2/BD0A5F74/1813E\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=FUzG9aoRlDUlW7MAl-8Uz7an7M2MlU1aU4MfM4A2Um9aM4-0gihFp2hmCIa0MYhknkhfnShfUlUsUNQ7ol7YL7CbM7LZL4vsL7U8Um6fozVFLzv4U4CaLRAFLzN4nl7PgjfJQ4Oeo4xmvsU0qIbtpYyPLR7Dg4NPLm9Jqdmnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1016&nid=9128&e=.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;<br /></p><p>茶话会节目形式丰富多元，令人目不暇接。既有婉转动人的独唱，用歌声直击心灵；也有气势磅礴的合唱，传递团结奋进的力量；还有充满奇幻色彩的魔术表演，引发阵阵惊叹；更有饱含深情的诗朗诵，让人沉浸在美好的意境之中。</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=FU4l94Lzf2M7LZMA8Csnm74MRNPLzQ1RUlliMN7snlWfLzN0gihFp2hmCIa0okyDL1yaLYhRLmf7L4LsLzL8UmMkMNVRnR6VM8lPLznkUmVFnRviL7W7U4fFUz7aLmvJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47aLzC0oz7Yokbw62m8c&oid=1391370217&tid=1016&nid=9128&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/86203C20D337134B3B6ACD7E7E114BB1/D750BDC0/A1027\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=FU4l94Lzf2M7LZMA8Csnm74MRNPLzQ1RUlliMN7snlWfLzN0gihFp2hmCIa0okyDL1yaLYhRLmf7L4LsLzL8UmMkMNVRnR6VM8lPLznkUmVFnRviL7W7U4fFUz7aLmvJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47aLzC0oz7Yokbw62m8c&oid=1391370217&tid=1016&nid=9128&e=.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;<br /></p><p>为了增添互动乐趣，节目间隙巧妙穿插了趣味盎然的游戏环节，大家踊跃参与，现场欢声笑语不断。激动人心的抽奖环节更是将气氛推向高潮，每当幸运号码公布，欢呼声与掌声便交织回荡，将现场的热情点燃。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=FnlQ9fL4VfMmV2LA4QVLzTVUmC8UNL1DLNQRolV7Mm9sU8l0gihFp2hmCIa0MkyPUYy4LSyinN7ioRVkoRC8Lln7L7WfU4C8LmnkMRGPU4MFLmC8LmrkLRTFLmMRozGJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47aLzC0oz7Yokbw62m8c&oid=1391370217&tid=1016&nid=9128&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/41C315FA581B8641DD0BAC6424B401C3/26425B09/23C90\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=FLlC9bM4W2nm78nAmUsMzNbnzGsMzA1kozNaUm-inmQRL7U0gihFp2hmCIa0MYyYMSyZokhknmNaUzl8oll4U4l4M46ko774U4Q7Uz-PnRQFUzv4MzA2nRWFLmC8L4NPgjfJQ4Oeo4xmvsU0qIbtpYyPLR7Dg4NPLm9Jqdmnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1016&nid=9128&e=.png\"></p><p><br /></p><p>随着一首激昂的《歌唱祖国》落下帷幕，迎新春教职工茶话会也画上了圆满的句号。</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=FUmC9YMmCiMNUPUAN7PUN-ZLRliL8l1ZMmLiM47iMRNZnz70gihFp2hmCIa0L1hfoSyZLkhfnml4L4NaL7nfL4CZMlnkMRnkLzV2M7V2oznFU49ZMRnRUzWFUlrVLR-Jv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47aLzC0oz7Yokbw62m8c&oid=1391370217&tid=1016&nid=9128&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/2A980AF533900DA3685DB44B11F4AF94/C8844CA2/AEE02\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=FUmC9YMmCiMNUPUAN7PUN-ZLRliL8l1ZMmLiM47iMRNZnz70gihFp2hmCIa0L1hfoSyZLkhfnml4L4NaL7nfL4CZMlnkMRnkLzV2M7V2oznFU49ZMRnRUzWFUlrVLR-Jv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47aLzC0oz7Yokbw62m8c&oid=1391370217&tid=1016&nid=9128&e=.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;<br /></p><p>回首2024年学院多项工作取得重大突破，计算机科学与技术学科首次入选中国最好学科排名榜，学科ESI接近阈值达60%较2023年增加15%；首次获批省科技进步二等奖1项，实现学科历史性突破；魏春燕老师获评高校辅导员年度人物，为学校首位获得该项国家荣誉的老师；本科生第一党支部荣获山西省首批高校育人先锋党建品牌项目；中北大学习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想大学生研习会入选中国青少年创新实践研究案例，成为团中央志愿宣讲团。</p><p>展望2025，我们信心满怀，全体计科人将以更加昂扬的姿态，砥砺奋进，为学院高质量发展和学校“双一流”创建贡献力量！</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=FoRC9ZM4laol-sLARCbUl7snR9PL471DL7Linz6kLN-PnRU0gihFp2hmCIa0M1yYMkyDnSyiLzU8LmMRMznRLzNPnRVVUz78M4nRLRUYL8rFUzM7UNlYLmMFnR9Pn7-Jv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47aLzC0oz7Yokbw62m8c&oid=1391370217&tid=1016&nid=9128&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/6246E514423C54C191D1EA1474C0423E/A3DBE223/D81DB\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=FoRC9ZM4laol-sLARCbUl7snR9PL471DL7Linz6kLN-PnRU0gihFp2hmCIa0M1yYMkyDnSyiLzU8LmMRMznRLzNPnRVVUz78M4nRLRUYL8rFUzM7UNlYLmMFnR9Pn7-Jv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47aLzC0oz7Yokbw62m8c&oid=1391370217&tid=1016&nid=9128&e=.png\"></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p></div><BR><BR></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://cst.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=FL8U9DL4Q2LmAVMAmGiUlC8LRAfMRl1PUzlDLmrRnNrRLz-0gihFp2hmCIa0L1yDUSybokh7UmT2U47PLRMfMmC8UNUsUlLsn77bLRM2nzWFUNUaUzr2M4nFLz9PL8lJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47aLzC0oz7Yokbw62m8c&oid=1391370217&tid=1016&nid=9128&e=.png"}